Count=150, windowSize=10. Then buffer holds last 100 values, indices 0..99 contain values from sample 51 to 150 (some mapping). idx would be 50 (since after 150 writes, idx = 150 mod 100 = 50). The most recent value is at idx-1 = 49, then 48, etc. The effectiveCount = min(totalCount, windowSize) = 10. The loop for i=0..9 will sum values from positions (49,48,...40). Those are the last 10 values. So correct. So algorithm works.

